# Peakflo Competitive Review Analysis

A data-driven competitive intelligence project analysing 316 real customer reviews across Peakflo and three of its direct competitors — Chargebee, Razorpay and Zoho Books.

---

## What This Project Does

This project collects, cleans and analyses real customer reviews to answer one business question:

> **Where are Peakflo's competitors losing customers — and how can Peakflo capitalise on that?**

---

## Key Findings

| Company | Reviews | Avg Sentiment | Negative Rate |
|---|---|---|---|
| Peakflo | 51 | +0.435 | 6% |
| Chargebee | 98 | +0.443 | 26% |
| Zoho Books | 93 | +0.483 | 19% |
| Razorpay | 78 | -0.255 | 65% |

- **Razorpay** is the only company with a negative average sentiment score (-0.255). 65% of all its reviews are negative, driven by payment holds, fraud complaints and zero support response.
- **Chargebee** has a 26% negative rate. Core complaints center around poor support quality and pricing discrimination against long-term customers.
- **Zoho Books** has a 19% negative rate. Customers report being transferred between support agents for hours with no resolution.
- **Peakflo** has a negative rate of just 6% — 10x better than Razorpay and 4x better than Chargebee.

