---

## Pipeline Overview

```
Stage 2 — Data Collection
    ↓
Collected manually using Instant Data Scraper browser extension
G2 blocked automated scraping — adapted and collected page by page
51 Peakflo reviews from G2 | 265 competitor reviews from Trustpilot

Stage 3 — Data Cleaning
    ↓
Removed duplicates, empty rows, and reviews under 20 characters
Standardised rating format and added review length column
316 clean reviews ready for analysis

Stage 4 — Exploratory Data Analysis
    ↓
Chart 1 — Rating distribution across all companies
Chart 2 — Top complaint words from negative reviews
Chart 3 — Total review volume per company
Chart 4 — Average star rating per company

Stage 5 — Sentiment Analysis
    ↓
VADER sentiment scoring for every review (-1 to +1)
Labelled each review as Positive, Neutral or Negative
Gap analysis — surfaced real complaints from competitor negative reviews

Stage 6 — Visualisation & Summary
    ↓
Chart 5 — Sentiment distribution per company
Chart 6 — Average sentiment score per company
Chart 7 — Negative review count per company
Final business insight and recommendation
```

