## Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python 3 | Core language |
| pandas | Data loading, cleaning, merging |
| matplotlib | Chart generation |
| seaborn | Chart styling |
| vaderSentiment | Sentiment analysis |
| re | Text cleaning and pattern extraction |
| Jupyter Notebook | Development and presentation |
| Instant Data Scraper | Browser extension for data collection |

---

## Data Sources

- **Peakflo** — G2 (g2.com/products/peakflo/reviews)
- **Chargebee** — Trustpilot
- **Razorpay** — Trustpilot
- **Zoho Books** — Trustpilot

### Transparency Note

Peakflo reviews were collected from G2, a B2B software review platform, while competitor reviews came from Trustpilot, which attracts a broader consumer audience. Trustpilot may naturally surface more negative reviews than G2. This limitation has been acknowledged throughout the analysis and does not change the core finding that all three competitors share consistent, pattern-level failures around customer support and payment reliability.

---

## Business Recommendation

All three competitors share one common failure — **poor customer support and broken trust around payments**. These are not minor complaints. They are the reasons customers switch providers.

Peakflo's support quality and payment reliability should be the central message in every sales conversation and marketing campaign — because this data proves it is exactly where every competitor is losing customers right now.

